{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2023-04-10 09:00:00', 'title': 'PEPSICO LAUNCHES GREENHOUSE ACCELERATOR PROGRAM: JUNTOS CRECEMOS EDITION TO IDENTIFY AND UPLIFT EMERGING HISPANIC-OWNED FOOD AND BEVERAGE START-UPS', 'text': 'PURCHASE, N.Y., APRIL 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, PEPSICO, INC. (NASDAQ:PEP) ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS GREENHOUSE ACCELERATOR PROGRAM: JUNTOS CRECEMOS (TOGETHER WE GROW) EDITION. THIS YEAR MARKS THE EIGHTH YEAR OF THE GREENHOUSE ACCELERATOR PROGRAM, AND THE FIRST-EVER HISPANIC EDITION, WHICH FOCUSES ON DRIVING GROWTH OF EMERGING HISPANIC-OWNED FOOD AND BEVERAGE BUSINESSES THROUGH COLLABORATION AND INNOVATION.'}